[
  {
    "RowOffset": 43910,
    "RowId": 2562,
    "TextData": "Clear Magitek Development"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 43946,
    "RowId": 2563,
    "TextData": "Divide into three groups and disable the barricade"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44010,
    "RowId": 2564,
    "TextData": "Reach the greater hold"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44046,
    "RowId": 2565,
    "TextData": "Clear the greater hold"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44082,
    "RowId": 2566,
    "TextData": "Defeat the Diablo Armament"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44122,
    "RowId": 2567,
    "TextData": "If we are to have any hope of lowering the ship's gangplank, we must send a small unit of soldiers to slip past their defenses."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44262,
    "RowId": 2568,
    "TextData": "Indeed. I should think no more than eight, lest they draw attention. We will do what we can to keep the imperials distracted, meanwhile the detachment must take the star chasers and steal inside."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44470,
    "RowId": 2569,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44482,
    "RowId": 2570,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44494,
    "RowId": 2571,
    "TextData": "The main force must press onward. We also need one unit down the left and right corridors."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44598,
    "RowId": 2572,
    "TextData": "You have come far, rebels, but no further."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44654,
    "RowId": 2573,
    "TextData": "I have at last unraveled the mysteries of auracite, you see, and I require an audience to my next great work..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44778,
    "RowId": 2574,
    "TextData": "Hahaha! Surprised, are we?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44818,
    "RowId": 2575,
    "TextData": "Yes, scream for me! I would hear every whimper, every cry─unto your dying wails of agony!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 44922,
    "RowId": 2576,
    "TextData": "I both pity and fear the man who might covet the terrible power of auracite."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45010,
    "RowId": 2577,
    "TextData": "I can but wonder what horrors yet await us..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45066,
    "RowId": 2578,
    "TextData": "For a blessing, our detachments continue to hold fast against the enemy. Let us press onward."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45170,
    "RowId": 2579,
    "TextData": "At last, the path is clear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45210,
    "RowId": 2580,
    "TextData": "There is still no sign of this Allagan relic."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45266,
    "RowId": 2581,
    "TextData": "Nor of their commander... We mustn't let down our guard. He could be upon us at any moment."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45370,
    "RowId": 2582,
    "TextData": "I must confess, you Bozjan savages are a clever lot, managing to wreak havoc on our engines."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45474,
    "RowId": 2583,
    "TextData": "But cheap tricks will not save you this time."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45530,
    "RowId": 2584,
    "TextData": "Welcome to the proving grounds for the latest and greatest of my magitek creations!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45626,
    "RowId": 2585,
    "TextData": "I-Impossible! ...Ugh, there are far better uses of my time than this.\nThe others should prove more than enough to deal with you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45770,
    "RowId": 2586,
    "TextData": "I expected more of his magitek toys. Pity..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45826,
    "RowId": 2587,
    "TextData": "Sartauvoir has taken care of matters on his end, like as not, meaning I should hurry and do the same here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 45946,
    "RowId": 2588,
    "TextData": "The flames of Mannatheihwo will reduce you to ash, one and all!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46022,
    "RowId": 2589,
    "TextData": "For...forgive me... Sartauvoir..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46066,
    "RowId": 2590,
    "TextData": "Well, well, you managed to beat back the flames."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46126,
    "RowId": 2591,
    "TextData": "Fine by me. Our pets could do with a little sport."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46190,
    "RowId": 2592,
    "TextData": "How...? How could this happen!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46234,
    "RowId": 2593,
    "TextData": "Mark me, savages: you <i>will</i> pay for this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46298,
    "RowId": 2594,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46310,
    "RowId": 2595,
    "TextData": "Aha, so it was you who thought to sneak inside. Well, this suits me just fine."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46402,
    "RowId": 2596,
    "TextData": "I'm afraid time is not on your side, friend, for it bends to my will!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46482,
    "RowId": 2597,
    "TextData": "It seems you truly do live up to your reputation."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46542,
    "RowId": 2598,
    "TextData": "But you've not won yet. I will offer my soul to the fires, if I must. Become flames made flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46650,
    "RowId": 2599,
    "TextData": "Ugh... I mustn't succumb to the flames. Not yet...\nI'll not sully his memory by giving up now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46758,
    "RowId": 2600,
    "TextData": "If this is where I must die, I will not do so alone! Basch! I pray you are watching!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46854,
    "RowId": 2601,
    "TextData": "Legatus Basch taught me well, as you will now see.\nI pour my all into this blade, kissed by the flames of Mannatheihwo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 46990,
    "RowId": 2602,
    "TextData": "The flames have been...extinguished."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47038,
    "RowId": 2603,
    "TextData": "Intruder alert! Intruder alert!\nDefense systems have been activated!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47122,
    "RowId": 2604,
    "TextData": "Damn it! Stay sharp, everyone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47166,
    "RowId": 2605,
    "TextData": "Enemy reinforcements! To arms!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47210,
    "RowId": 2606,
    "TextData": "Oi! How many times do I have to teach this lesson, <If(PlayerParameter(4))>girl<Else/>boy</If>? When I put you down, you <i>stay</i> down!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47338,
    "RowId": 2607,
    "TextData": "Quit playing around, Menenius, and follow my lead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47402,
    "RowId": 2608,
    "TextData": "\\\\<sigh> If you insist..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47438,
    "RowId": 2609,
    "TextData": "Energy levels at maximum... Engage!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47486,
    "RowId": 2610,
    "TextData": "Is this the best the Resistance can offer? Pathetic!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47550,
    "RowId": 2611,
    "TextData": "Priority target...acquired! Destroy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47598,
    "RowId": 2612,
    "TextData": "Deploy replicants... Prepare to fire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47646,
    "RowId": 2613,
    "TextData": "Heavy damage sustained... Systems critical!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47702,
    "RowId": 2614,
    "TextData": "Weapons charged to maximum... Initiating execution protocol!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47774,
    "RowId": 2615,
    "TextData": "Sys...tem... Fail...ure..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47814,
    "RowId": 2616,
    "TextData": "Priority target eliminated... Mission complete."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47874,
    "RowId": 2617,
    "TextData": "That's quite far enough."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47910,
    "RowId": 2618,
    "TextData": "Let the fires burn so hot as to set their souls aflame!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 47978,
    "RowId": 2619,
    "TextData": "By a confluence of water and wind shall we smite the Resistance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48054,
    "RowId": 2620,
    "TextData": "Let none doubt the power of the IVth's cadre of mages!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48122,
    "RowId": 2621,
    "TextData": "Hold nothing back, brothers and sisters!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48174,
    "RowId": 2622,
    "TextData": "O Hanbi, bringer of ruin, we offer unto you these wayward warriors. Their blood to stay your thirst, their souls your hunger. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48314,
    "RowId": 2623,
    "TextData": "Death comes to all who stand in your shadow, and we ask you cast it now over those who would trespass against us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48438,
    "RowId": 2624,
    "TextData": "I see you've found my cavaliers, good.\nA fine opportunity to test the battle capabilities of the clibanarius."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48562,
    "RowId": 2625,
    "TextData": "This is absurd... Surround them, and let the scorpion finish them off!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48646,
    "RowId": 2626,
    "TextData": "Surely they're no match for both the satellite and the scorpion in tandem?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48734,
    "RowId": 2627,
    "TextData": "This shouldn't be happening... Ready the death machines, with as much ammunition as they can carry!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48846,
    "RowId": 2628,
    "TextData": "We yet remain unscathed, though I honestly cannot say how. Now, we wait for the others to do their part."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 48962,
    "RowId": 2629,
    "TextData": "He would turn us into monsters as well! On your guard, everyone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49038,
    "RowId": 2630,
    "TextData": "You've arrived at last..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49074,
    "RowId": 2631,
    "TextData": "I'm releasing aether from my armor's core. Take it, Lyon! I'll not have you bowing out just yet."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49182,
    "RowId": 2632,
    "TextData": "Dawon! I need you to feed some aether into that toy of his. We still need him for this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49282,
    "RowId": 2633,
    "TextData": "The liberator come to cut the head off the snake. How brave...yet foolish."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49370,
    "RowId": 2634,
    "TextData": "The security system appears to be linked between these two corridors."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49450,
    "RowId": 2635,
    "TextData": "If it is to be disabled, no doubt we must do so from both sides. Let us make haste."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49546,
    "RowId": 2636,
    "TextData": "Dawon, no! Damn it all!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49582,
    "RowId": 2637,
    "TextData": "Bah! Incompetent, the lot of you! Send in the colossi! They mustn't be allowed any further!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49686,
    "RowId": 2638,
    "TextData": "But...the auracite! How could you...gaaaaaah!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 49742,
    "RowId": 2639,
    "TextData": "Activate the gangplank"
  },
  {
