  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50438,
    "RowId": 2695,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50450,
    "RowId": 2696,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50462,
    "RowId": 2697,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50474,
    "RowId": 2698,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50486,
    "RowId": 2699,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50498,
    "RowId": 2700,
    "TextData": "Your brains... I shall gorge upon them..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50550,
    "RowId": 2701,
    "TextData": "Your minds are mine to command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50594,
    "RowId": 2702,
    "TextData": "Relinquish your wills to me...and hasten to your doom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50662,
    "RowId": 2703,
    "TextData": "If only I had my feast... Then you would..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50718,
    "RowId": 2704,
    "TextData": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50730,
    "RowId": 2705,
    "TextData": "Break this accursed seal... Set me free!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50782,
    "RowId": 2706,
    "TextData": "Grrr... The seal... You meddlesome curs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50834,
    "RowId": 2707,
    "TextData": "The demon is gathering its power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50878,
    "RowId": 2708,
    "TextData": "My servants... Come to me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50918,
    "RowId": 2709,
    "TextData": "Free at last! Now for your just reward...I shall rend you asunder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 50998,
    "RowId": 2710,
    "TextData": "Those patterns...they are his!? No, I shall have my freedom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51070,
    "RowId": 2711,
    "TextData": "Urgh... My life...slips away..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51114,
    "RowId": 2712,
    "TextData": "Welcome to my humble shop! Feast your eyes upon wondrous wares sold at a pittance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51210,
    "RowId": 2713,
    "TextData": "Cursed treasures from Amdapor, Skalla, Mhach, and beyond! There's an item to tickle every fancy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51318,
    "RowId": 2714,
    "TextData": "I believe I have just the thing for you... Yes, yes, it suits you perfectly! In fact, I can't let you leave until you buy this magnificent piece!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51474,
    "RowId": 2715,
    "TextData": "Be warned, you must pay the exact price. No more, and no less! Excess coins shall carry a terrible curse..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51594,
    "RowId": 2716,
    "TextData": "ああ、ちゃんと買い物できなかったのカァ……\nじゃあ、呪われても仕方ないネェ！ "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51722,
    "RowId": 2717,
    "TextData": "Now behold, my finest offerings! Each one bearing a more wicked curse than the last!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51818,
    "RowId": 2718,
    "TextData": "×△AcTivatE△×◎CLUNK◎×▼aCtiVATe▼\nDeSTroy, dEstROY, DesTROY..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51906,
    "RowId": 2719,
    "TextData": "×△DePLoy△×◎WHIR◎×▼MaGIc▼\nILLusioN, illUSIOn, ILluSiOn..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 51994,
    "RowId": 2720,
    "TextData": "××△キジュツ△××◎マリョク◎××▼モットキョウキュウ▼\nゲンエイ、ゲンエイ、ゲンエイ……"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52138,
    "RowId": 2721,
    "TextData": "×△MaGIc△×◎CLICK◎×▼ENhanCED▼\nILLusioN, illUSIOn, ILluSiOn..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52226,
    "RowId": 2722,
    "TextData": "×△TaCTics△×◎CLICK◎×▼MODifiED▼\nBARRage, barrAGE, BaRraGe..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52314,
    "RowId": 2723,
    "TextData": "Intruders sighted. Moving to eliminate immediately."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52378,
    "RowId": 2724,
    "TextData": "Resistance confirmed. Deploying cannons."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52430,
    "RowId": 2725,
    "TextData": "Resistance persists. Apprehending intruders."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52486,
    "RowId": 2726,
    "TextData": "Resistance reaching dangerous levels. Employing incapacitating force."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52566,
    "RowId": 2727,
    "TextData": "Situation dire. Switching to strategy of assured destruction."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52638,
    "RowId": 2728,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink, oink! Tricksy trio unite!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52686,
    "RowId": 2729,
    "TextData": "The tricksy trio unites anew, and this time we're serious! Oink!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52762,
    "RowId": 2730,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink! Behold the true power of our tenacious triumvirate!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52838,
    "RowId": 2731,
    "TextData": "Get ready for Triton's flammable extravaganza!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52898,
    "RowId": 2732,
    "TextData": "Or rather, behold the true power of Triton─star of the show!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 52974,
    "RowId": 2733,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink! I'm a flaming menace, through and through!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53042,
    "RowId": 2734,
    "TextData": "Sssnooowed uuunder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53074,
    "RowId": 2735,
    "TextData": "Oinking fools! It's Nereid's turn to take center stage!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53142,
    "RowId": 2736,
    "TextData": "You're nothing more than a pair of frosty unfortunates!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53210,
    "RowId": 2737,
    "TextData": "Brace yourselves for a putrid poison blast!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53266,
    "RowId": 2738,
    "TextData": "Just kidding, it's Phobos's time to shine! Oink!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53326,
    "RowId": 2739,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink, oink! You're in for some toxic trouble now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53394,
    "RowId": 2740,
    "TextData": "F-Forgive me friends! I promise I'll behave myself now..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53462,
    "RowId": 2741,
    "TextData": "I-I'm sorry! I'll play nice... I swear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53514,
    "RowId": 2742,
    "TextData": "My flame grows dim! I give in!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53558,
    "RowId": 2743,
    "TextData": "My poisons have all dried up!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53598,
    "RowId": 2744,
    "TextData": "Oinksome wretches! I can't stand the sight of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53662,
    "RowId": 2745,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink, oink!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53690,
    "RowId": 2746,
    "TextData": "Oooiiink!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53710,
    "RowId": 2747,
    "TextData": "It's oink-oink-over! We're outta here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53762,
    "RowId": 2748,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink! Everyone gets a piece of the action!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53822,
    "RowId": 2749,
    "TextData": "Armed trespassers detected. They must be eliminated."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53886,
    "RowId": 2750,
    "TextData": "\\\\<clank> Deploying defense units!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53930,
    "RowId": 2751,
    "TextData": "\\\\<clunk> \\\\<click> Summoning reinforcements!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 53982,
    "RowId": 2752,
    "TextData": "Autonomy granted to defense units. Show no mercy to the intruders!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54062,
    "RowId": 2753,
    "TextData": "\\\\<click> Granting permission for special offensive maneuvers!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54134,
    "RowId": 2754,
    "TextData": "Dangerous elements remain. Permitting free use of entire arsenal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54210,
    "RowId": 2755,
    "TextData": "\\\\<clank> \\\\<clunk> Granting permission for self-destruction!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54278,
    "RowId": 2756,
    "TextData": "Oh dear customers, you do know the value of these rare treasures, yes?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54362,
    "RowId": 2757,
    "TextData": "You may only carry two bags of coins─remember! Break my rule at your own peril..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54458,
    "RowId": 2758,
    "TextData": "All who threaten the tower's sanctity will be purged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54522,
    "RowId": 2759,
    "TextData": "I call forth the might of the sanguine!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54574,
    "RowId": 2760,
    "TextData": "Unfettered power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54602,
    "RowId": 2761,
    "TextData": "Vile infractors, prepare to meet your end!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54658,
    "RowId": 2762,
    "TextData": "I commit my strength, my blood...my life!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54710,
    "RowId": 2763,
    "TextData": "Beginning authentication process..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54758,
    "RowId": 2764,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 60 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54810,
    "RowId": 2765,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 30 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54862,
    "RowId": 2766,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 20 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54914,
    "RowId": 2767,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 10 seconds..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 54966,
    "RowId": 2768,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 5..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55010,
    "RowId": 2769,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 4..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55054,
    "RowId": 2770,
    "TextData": "Hrrrghhh... Grrr..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55086,
    "RowId": 2771,
    "TextData": "Grrr... Be...gone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55118,
    "RowId": 2772,
    "TextData": "Graaahhhrrr!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55142,
    "RowId": 2773,
    "TextData": "Hrrrng... You will not...escape!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55186,
    "RowId": 2774,
    "TextData": "All...shall turn to dust..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55226,
    "RowId": 2775,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete. Begin the unlock process."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55290,
    "RowId": 2776,
    "TextData": "Occult cylinders active. Initiate the authentication process."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55362,
    "RowId": 2777,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 3..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55406,
    "RowId": 2778,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 2..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55450,
    "RowId": 2779,
    "TextData": "Authentication complete in 1..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55494,
    "RowId": 2780,
    "TextData": "The lock is unbound... The path ahead is clear."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55554,
    "RowId": 2781,
    "TextData": "Clear the Palaeography Room"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55594,
    "RowId": 2782,
    "TextData": "Clear the central passages"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55634,
    "RowId": 2783,
    "TextData": "Clear the Astronomy Room"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55670,
    "RowId": 2784,
    "TextData": "Clear the pronged passage"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55706,
    "RowId": 2785,
    "TextData": "Clear the Glaciology Forum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55746,
    "RowId": 2786,
    "TextData": "Clear the binding lock"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55782,
    "RowId": 2787,
    "TextData": "Clear the Haematology Room"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55822,
    "RowId": 2788,
    "TextData": "Allow me to start by showing you this marvelous red ruby from the city of Mhach! Within it burns fire not of this world!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 55954,
    "RowId": 2789,
    "TextData": "Our next masterwork is from Skalla, that abode of mages most mighty! A sapphire of such chilling cold that life itself freezes at its touch!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 56106,
    "RowId": 2790,
    "TextData": "And lastly, my personal favorite... The shell of a tortoise, polished to a mirror sheen and slippery smooth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 56226,
    "RowId": 2791,
    "TextData": "Oink, oink! Prepare to die at the hands of we tricksy three!"
  },
