  {
    "RowOffset": 57982,
    "RowId": 3100,
    "TextData": "<If(PlayerParameter(4))>Mistress<Else/>Master</If> <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, it looks like <PcName>IntegerParameter(1)</PcName> decided to visit!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 58074,
    "RowId": 3101,
    "TextData": "Guess what, <If(PlayerParameter(4))>Mistress<Else/>Master</If> <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! <PcName>IntegerParameter(1)</PcName> is here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 58158,
    "RowId": 3102,
    "TextData": "<If(PlayerParameter(4))>Mistress<Else/>Master</If> <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, a structure has been completed! You need but access the appropriate logboard to give it a final inspection!"
  },
